WEBVTT

00:00:03.153 --> 00:00:07.188
CANDY CANDY

00:00:09.321 --> 00:00:15.486
Sobakasu nante kinishinai wa.

00:00:16.188 --> 00:00:21.634
Hana pecha datte datte datte oki ni iri.

00:00:22.626 --> 00:00:25.631
Otenba itazura daisuki,

00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:28.842
Kakekko sukippu daisuki;

00:00:28.877 --> 00:00:33.906
Watashi wa, watashi wa, watashi wa Candy!

00:00:35.302 --> 00:00:41.138
Hitoripocchi de iru to choppiri samishii.

00:00:41.411 --> 00:00:47.286
Sonna toki kou iu no kagami wo mitsumete:

00:00:47.321 --> 00:00:53.450
Waratte, waratte, waratte Candy!

00:00:53.485 --> 00:00:56.328
Nakibeso nante sayonara!

00:00:56.363 --> 00:00:59.615
Nee, Candy Candy!

00:01:06.993 --> 00:01:11.509
A pretty, lasso-wielding girl.

00:01:20.275 --> 00:01:21.513
America.

00:01:22.372 --> 00:01:26.369
Just south of the Michigan lake,
near the small mountain village,

00:01:26.404 --> 00:01:30.271
there used to be an old church
called "Pony's home".

00:01:31.744 --> 00:01:35.836
In Pony's home, together with
two caring nuns,

00:01:36.165 --> 00:01:39.903
lived children who had nobody
of their own.

00:01:44.139 --> 00:01:49.375
They were called Sister Pony
and Sister Lane.

00:02:00.556 --> 00:02:04.127
Come on, you don't need
to be afraid of a boogie man!

00:02:05.437 --> 00:02:06.989
Snow is all strange to you, right?

00:02:08.475 --> 00:02:10.182
Come on, eat up.

00:02:13.742 --> 00:02:14.722
Tom!

00:02:16.362 --> 00:02:18.025
Sister Lane.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:26.494
A baby is crying.

00:02:27.617 --> 00:02:31.037
Tom was trying to tell us
about the crying baby!

00:02:33.483 --> 00:02:35.746
Watch your step!

00:02:37.445 --> 00:02:39.529
It's here, sister Pony!

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:46.268
In such a snow...

00:02:47.878 --> 00:02:49.581
There is a note attached, too!

00:02:53.639 --> 00:02:57.942
I couldn't take care of her anymore,
no matter how much I tried.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.020
Her name is Annie.

00:03:01.212 --> 00:03:02.959
Annie?

00:03:03.574 --> 00:03:05.451
She smiled.

00:03:07.746 --> 00:03:09.628
It's okay, Annie.

00:03:09.663 --> 00:03:11.304
Sister Pony, another baby!

00:03:22.331 --> 00:03:24.028
Sister Pony, it's here!

00:03:25.344 --> 00:03:27.651
My, my, what a lively baby!

00:03:28.521 --> 00:03:30.583
Did you find any notes?

00:03:31.155 --> 00:03:32.972
Only this doll.

00:03:33.955 --> 00:03:35.173
Candy?

00:03:38.019 --> 00:03:40.513
Your name is Candy?

00:03:42.963 --> 00:03:46.196
So... you are Candy.

00:03:48.414 --> 00:03:51.115
And in such a white day...

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:53.876
Because we found her on such a white day,
let her name be Candice White.

00:03:56.834 --> 00:03:59.902
Candy the prankster and little Annie!

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:39.735
What's going on?

00:04:50.159 --> 00:04:53.548
From that time, exactly six years
have passed.

00:04:54.030 --> 00:05:00.580
Years quickly flew by. Annie, Candy
and Tom have already grown this big!

00:05:11.828 --> 00:05:15.640
Why doesn't my snowman look anything
like Annie's?

00:05:15.879 --> 00:05:18.317
Candy, it's good.

00:05:18.739 --> 00:05:20.185
I'll climb on its head!

00:05:27.646 --> 00:05:29.423
Candy, are you okay?

00:05:33.489 --> 00:05:34.845
Thank God.

00:05:35.974 --> 00:05:37.800
They're coming this way!

00:05:40.526 --> 00:05:42.110
-Look out!
-Move it!

00:05:44.595 --> 00:05:46.581
My snowman!

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:48.699
Now you've done it!

00:05:50.089 --> 00:05:51.951
Tom, wait up!

00:06:00.436 --> 00:06:01.589
Candy!

00:06:02.274 --> 00:06:03.254
Candy!

00:06:03.585 --> 00:06:04.690
Annie!

00:06:05.311 --> 00:06:07.313
Tom, apologize to her!

00:06:09.057 --> 00:06:12.410
Candy, it's okay.
Candy...

00:06:13.135 --> 00:06:16.594
She may be okay with that,
but I'm not. Apologize to her, Tom!

00:06:18.953 --> 00:06:20.538
Sorry...

00:06:36.526 --> 00:06:37.611
It's springtime.

00:06:38.253 --> 00:06:41.500
In the forrest, on the hill,
and in the fields - spring is everywhere.

00:06:41.535 --> 00:06:45.300
It's springtime for all the
kids and animals, too.

00:06:52.008 --> 00:06:53.128
Oh, my!

00:06:55.012 --> 00:06:57.459
That's terrible.

00:06:58.516 --> 00:07:00.364
Must be Candy's doing.

00:07:00.904 --> 00:07:02.117
Candy?

00:07:02.591 --> 00:07:03.587
Candy!

00:07:04.267 --> 00:07:05.711
I'm here!

00:07:05.746 --> 00:07:07.168
Where?

00:07:08.955 --> 00:07:10.926
Up here, sister Lane!

00:07:11.697 --> 00:07:14.829
They fell from their nest
so I put them back in!

00:07:14.864 --> 00:07:17.995
Candy!
It's dangerous, come down quickly.

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:19.092
Okay!

00:07:19.521 --> 00:07:23.144
No! Not like that!
Be careful! Come down slowly...!

00:07:29.516 --> 00:07:31.702
Candy! Are you okay?

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:35.293
Are you hurt?

00:07:40.003 --> 00:07:41.168
Candy!!!

00:07:44.102 --> 00:07:45.043
Candy.

00:07:45.753 --> 00:07:48.453
Why did you do that prank for?

00:07:48.896 --> 00:07:50.644
Because...

00:07:50.999 --> 00:07:55.004
Candy, did you think about
the poor ducklings?

00:07:55.101 --> 00:07:57.295
I did it because I'm sad.

00:07:57.882 --> 00:07:59.488
Candy!

00:07:59.779 --> 00:08:04.243
Because ducklings that get separated
from their mama are so sad.

00:08:04.278 --> 00:08:09.310
For ducklings, there are no kind
people like sister Pony and sister Lane.

00:08:09.806 --> 00:08:12.108
And they'd be left alone.

00:08:15.411 --> 00:08:17.350
You can go, Candy.

00:08:17.772 --> 00:08:19.296
Okay!

00:08:24.154 --> 00:08:27.259
Sister Pony, don't you think
we overdid this a bit?

00:08:27.294 --> 00:08:30.715
Sister Lane, scolding Candy
was your idea, right?

00:08:32.575 --> 00:08:34.550
Well...

00:08:35.364 --> 00:08:37.475
Look over there, sister Lane.

00:08:40.054 --> 00:08:42.089
-Candy!
-Annie!

00:08:42.124 --> 00:08:46.389
My heart is racing as if I were
the one being scolded.

00:08:47.086 --> 00:08:48.236
Really.

00:08:48.271 --> 00:08:50.193
I must be more careful
from now on.

00:08:51.781 --> 00:08:57.088
If I keep doing these things, your heart
will pound, and I don't want that to happen.

00:08:58.949 --> 00:09:00.304
Candy!

00:09:02.905 --> 00:09:06.275
How could we ever scold them?
Just look at them.

00:09:07.197 --> 00:09:09.182
It's almost as if this
were their last.

00:09:09.367 --> 00:09:11.777
What's the matter, sister Pony?

00:09:12.195 --> 00:09:17.437
I'm thinking about the day when
they'll be separated from each other.

00:09:17.589 --> 00:09:21.394
A day will come when
one of them will get adopted.

00:09:22.588 --> 00:09:26.504
Perhaps it won't happen for a while...

00:09:28.192 --> 00:09:31.701
No, it could happen three days from now.

00:09:42.635 --> 00:09:49.892
Every term, children from Pony's home
are studying good manners, in order to...

00:09:51.431 --> 00:09:56.931
...make themselves look better to adopters
who will come to see them in three days.

00:09:58.556 --> 00:10:05.257
Every one of them is dreaming about
a happy life with kind adopters.

00:10:05.935 --> 00:10:09.204
However, Candy and Annie don't think that way.

00:10:16.014 --> 00:10:18.630
Candy, Annie, stop fooling around!

00:10:32.267 --> 00:10:37.669
If you didn't want to leave, why didn't you
say so? Why are you pretending to be bad?

00:10:37.956 --> 00:10:39.698
I am sorry...

00:10:39.936 --> 00:10:42.354
Candy, don't you think this was bad?

00:10:42.785 --> 00:10:46.203
I want to stay with Annie forever.

00:10:46.535 --> 00:10:51.415
You were willing to risk happiness
of other children for your own?

00:10:52.239 --> 00:10:53.812
Other children?

00:10:54.418 --> 00:10:59.305
They were laughed at because of you.

00:10:59.745 --> 00:11:01.014
Everyone?

00:11:01.419 --> 00:11:02.789
That's right.

00:11:02.888 --> 00:11:07.705
Children from Pony's home are well
known for their good manners,

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:10.612
but this could change if the two
of you keep making trouble.

00:11:11.661 --> 00:11:15.860
I'm sorry, sister Pony!

00:11:20.119 --> 00:11:27.256
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
This is a free fansub.
Do not disassemble or eat small parts!

00:11:30.506 --> 00:11:32.761
Four more years have flown by.

00:11:33.243 --> 00:11:36.578
Candy and Annie are celebrating
their tenth birthdays.

00:11:56.074 --> 00:11:58.226
Well then, Candy, Annie.

00:12:01.436 --> 00:12:04.124
Candy, Annie, congratulations!

00:12:07.304 --> 00:12:10.873
Candy, Annie, happy birthday!

00:12:11.153 --> 00:12:12.957
Thank you!

00:12:13.459 --> 00:12:17.105
Hey, how come Candy and Annie have
a birthday on the same day?

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:19.105
John, you see...

00:12:19.718 --> 00:12:23.117
In all, Annie and I were found
together on the same day.

00:12:23.211 --> 00:12:25.816
Since our real birthdays are unknown,
we say that we were born on the day...

00:12:25.817 --> 00:12:27.692
...they found us in the snow.

00:12:27.693 --> 00:12:30.721
Hey, I wish they found
me with you, too!

00:12:30.948 --> 00:12:32.529
John, you!

00:12:34.077 --> 00:12:36.018
Thanks, thanks.

00:12:36.704 --> 00:12:41.881
Candy! Your new papa and mama
will be mad if you do that!

00:12:42.874 --> 00:12:46.636
We'll stay here until we turn into
little old grannies, right, Annie?

00:12:46.823 --> 00:12:47.820
Yeah...

00:12:48.345 --> 00:12:51.301
Saying such a thing is nice,
right, Tom?

00:12:54.605 --> 00:12:56.535
Something happened to him?

00:12:56.570 --> 00:12:58.019
Something wonderful.

00:12:58.087 --> 00:13:04.468
Once the snow melts, Tom will
be taken away by a wealthy farmer.

00:13:05.409 --> 00:13:08.218
Then, Tom gets to have a father
and a mother?

00:13:08.468 --> 00:13:10.996
That's right. They are really
wonderful people.

00:13:16.133 --> 00:13:18.748
-What is it?
-Candy!

00:13:19.028 --> 00:13:22.882
Somebody wants to take this prankster?
They've gotta be some weird-ass people!

00:13:23.845 --> 00:13:25.455
Don't be like that, Candy.

00:13:25.625 --> 00:13:27.184
I'll get adopted one day, too!

00:13:27.219 --> 00:13:30.720
Nobody will take a tomboy like you!

00:13:33.566 --> 00:13:34.899
Get him, Candy!

00:13:41.133 --> 00:13:42.736
I'm not gonna lose to her...!

00:13:43.332 --> 00:13:44.320
Candy, stop that!

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:58.336
Tom will be leaving soon, can't
you two get along till the end?

00:13:58.371 --> 00:14:01.719
Oww...
I can't wait to see you go!

00:14:01.744 --> 00:14:03.747
And I'll finally be at peace!

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:14.996
Candy, what do you think, what kind
of people are Tom's new parents?

00:14:15.391 --> 00:14:17.330
It doesn't matter at all!

00:14:17.365 --> 00:14:20.125
He won't get adopted because Tom
is way too crooked.

00:14:20.289 --> 00:14:23.015
Candy!
How can you say that!

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:23.886
Annie?

00:14:23.921 --> 00:14:26.603
Why can't you be happy for him?

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:31.268
I'll tell you then; do you think he'll
be happy if he's taken away from here?

00:14:31.559 --> 00:14:32.707
Well...

00:14:32.743 --> 00:14:37.421
I like Pony's home. I like Annie.
I don't want to be taken anywhere.

00:14:37.812 --> 00:14:41.272
Candy!
I like you too!

00:14:47.978 --> 00:14:49.545
What's that sound?

00:14:52.382 --> 00:14:53.613
Tom?

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:00.137
Damn.

00:15:12.214 --> 00:15:13.340
Candy!

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:18.059
You're never gonna become a cowboy
if you keep throwing like that!

00:15:18.723 --> 00:15:20.608
Shut up, I'm doing my best!

00:15:21.218 --> 00:15:25.300
If you want, Candy, the lasso master,
will show you how it's done!

00:15:25.335 --> 00:15:28.137
Who needs you... go away!

00:15:28.172 --> 00:15:30.675
Let's see what you've got then!
Here you go.

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:39.184
Your aim is off a little bit!

00:15:39.944 --> 00:15:40.971
Don't touch that!

00:15:41.192 --> 00:15:44.512
This hat was given to me
by my future father.

00:15:47.638 --> 00:15:49.746
What's up with this hat?

00:15:49.781 --> 00:15:50.945
Shut up!

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:55.085
Now you've done it!

00:15:55.752 --> 00:15:57.838
Stop that!

00:15:58.584 --> 00:16:00.557
I won't give up to you!

00:16:04.843 --> 00:16:06.838
Candy, are you okay?

00:16:09.735 --> 00:16:12.435
Tom, when did you become so strong?

00:16:12.637 --> 00:16:13.754
I always was.

00:16:13.789 --> 00:16:14.890
Then, you were...

00:16:14.925 --> 00:16:17.391
I didn't want to hurt
a nice girl like you.

00:16:19.851 --> 00:16:21.486
Tom, you fool!

00:16:21.966 --> 00:16:23.171
Candy!

00:16:25.525 --> 00:16:29.030
I hate you! Go away to your
new father!

00:16:29.065 --> 00:16:32.930
Kurin, Candy is crying.
I never saw her cry before.

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:47.453
Snow is gone. The day of Tom's
departure is finally here.

00:16:56.332 --> 00:17:02.966
Teacher, leave this guy to me!
I'm going to make a great man out of him!

00:17:03.447 --> 00:17:05.446
Thank you very much.

00:17:05.786 --> 00:17:07.246
Take care, Tom.

00:17:08.939 --> 00:17:11.456
Well then, Tom, say goodbye to everybody.

00:17:11.491 --> 00:17:14.265
Uh... I...

00:17:18.349 --> 00:17:20.033
You idiot!

00:17:22.228 --> 00:17:26.873
They've been taking care of you for ten years,
and you can't even thank them properly?

00:17:26.908 --> 00:17:28.443
Tom, are you okay?

00:17:29.237 --> 00:17:30.476
Wait a minute, mister!

00:17:30.941 --> 00:17:32.398
Candy!

00:17:32.798 --> 00:17:34.473
What?

00:17:34.508 --> 00:17:36.308
Tom hasn't gone with you yet!

00:17:37.465 --> 00:17:40.288
You've barely known him for one
day, and you've already hit him!

00:17:40.323 --> 00:17:43.144
This is Steve's way of doing things.

00:17:43.179 --> 00:17:47.346
Ah, so. Tom, don't go with
this ruffian!

00:17:47.493 --> 00:17:49.119
What are you saying, Candy?

00:17:50.433 --> 00:17:54.310
Tom, do you really think you will
be happy once this bad man adopts you?

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:57.088
But sometimes, I get violent, too...

00:17:57.478 --> 00:17:58.479
Tom...

00:18:02.245 --> 00:18:03.466
Amazing...

00:18:03.501 --> 00:18:05.454
With hands this big...

00:18:10.829 --> 00:18:14.627
Everyone, look! These are the
hands of my future father!

00:18:16.613 --> 00:18:20.655
My hands are someday going
to be this huge, too!

00:18:23.682 --> 00:18:24.793
Tom...

00:18:26.592 --> 00:18:30.270
Sister Pony, sister Lane,
thank you for everything.

00:18:30.396 --> 00:18:32.417
I will work and do my best!

00:18:32.503 --> 00:18:35.263
-I know you will.
-Send us a letter.

00:18:35.298 --> 00:18:36.715
Thank you, everybody!

00:18:38.805 --> 00:18:40.073
Goodbye, Annie.

00:18:41.104 --> 00:18:42.062
Tom...

00:18:42.109 --> 00:18:43.466
Bye, Kurin.

00:18:45.549 --> 00:18:46.632
Candy.

00:18:46.918 --> 00:18:49.892
You know, I really wanted you
to teach me how to throw a lasso.

00:18:50.393 --> 00:18:52.754
And I wanted to teach you.

00:18:54.319 --> 00:18:56.119
Son, let's get on our way!

00:18:56.531 --> 00:18:57.829
Coming, Mr. Steve!

00:18:59.165 --> 00:19:02.132
You fool. From now on,
it's "daddy".

00:19:02.167 --> 00:19:03.619
Daddy.

00:19:05.245 --> 00:19:08.007
Alright! You're now my successor!

00:19:08.184 --> 00:19:09.205
There you go.

00:19:15.849 --> 00:19:17.467
Well then, excuse us.

00:19:20.209 --> 00:19:22.907
Farewell!

00:19:22.942 --> 00:19:24.282
Farewell, Tom!

00:19:35.419 --> 00:19:41.576
He never told you this, but it was him
who first heard you two crying...

00:19:41.611 --> 00:19:45.517
...on that night when two of you
were abandoned in the snow.

00:19:45.546 --> 00:19:47.542
It was Tom who found us...?

00:19:51.574 --> 00:19:53.125
Annie, I know of a shortcut.

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:20.228
-Tom!
-Thank you, Tom!

00:20:20.477 --> 00:20:24.188
Farewell, Candy, Annie!

00:20:24.251 --> 00:20:27.473
Tom!
If somebody beats you, fight back!

00:20:27.508 --> 00:20:30.076
Candy! Annie!

00:20:30.439 --> 00:20:34.558
Farewell, Tom!

00:20:44.951 --> 00:20:47.477
Somehow, he looks like a real father.

00:20:51.963 --> 00:20:53.463
What's the matter, Annie?

00:20:58.021 --> 00:20:59.575
Annie?

00:20:59.995 --> 00:21:03.085
I want them too... gentle papa and mama...

00:21:06.257 --> 00:21:08.786
Annie...
Let's trade.

00:21:10.909 --> 00:21:12.242
Here's a kiss from mama.

00:21:13.272 --> 00:21:15.651
Then... a kiss from papa.

00:21:18.611 --> 00:21:20.368
My papa is Annie.

00:21:20.403 --> 00:21:22.568
My mama is Candy.

00:21:22.603 --> 00:21:24.681
-Annie!
-Candy!

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:30.856
Annie trembled from sorrow in Candy's arms.

00:21:30.891 --> 00:21:36.324
A day when two of them will have to
part their ways is drawing near.

00:21:37.857 --> 00:21:39.657
To be continued...

00:21:45.262 --> 00:21:53.253
Ashita wa doko kara
umarete kuru no

00:21:53.288 --> 00:22:02.315
Watashi wa, ashita ga,
ashita ga suki.

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:11.374
Suteki na koto ga
ari sore

00:22:11.409 --> 00:22:20.473
Watashi wa, ashita ga
ashita ga suki.

00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:29.356
Kirakira hikaru
Kaze no mukou de

00:22:29.391 --> 00:22:39.050
Ano hito ga watashi wo
Watashi wo yondeiru - -

00:22:40.158 --> 00:22:50.213
Candy, Candy, Candy, Candy.
